@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam ArrowColor #111111
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor #111111
skinparam LifeLineBackgroundColor white
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #111111
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white
skinparam SequenceBoxBorderColor #111111
skinparam SequenceBoxBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor #111111
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white

actor "用户" as User
participant "题目详情页" as Page
participant "Gateway" as Gateway
participant "PostAnswerQuestionController" as Controller
participant "PostAnswerQuestionService" as Service
database "MySQL" as DB

User -> Page: 输入答案并点击提交
Page -> Gateway: POST /user/answer/submitAnswer
Gateway -> Gateway: 注入 X-User-Id
Gateway -> Controller: 转发提交请求
Controller -> Service: submitAnswer(answerId, userId)
Service -> Service: 校验参数与用户身份
Service -> DB: 查询答题记录
DB --> Service: 返回答题记录

alt 记录不存在或用户不匹配
  Service --> Controller: 返回失败状态
  Controller --> Page: 返回错误提示
else 记录有效且未提交
  Service -> DB: 更新提交状态与提交时间
  DB --> Service: 更新成功
  Service --> Controller: 返回成功状态
  Controller --> Page: 返回提交成功
end
@enduml
